# The run logs of the loop are evidence and are committed, the same way steps/logs is.
# The root .gitignore hides every *.log as local scratch, so without this line a run log
# written here never reaches GitHub, and the one record of what a loop run did is lost.
!*.log

# What a run WRITES is never committed: the models, the workbooks, the pages and the
# pictures. They stay under %LOCALAPPDATA%\NwcFederatorLoop. Only the read-outs of them,
# which are text, come here.
*.nwc
*.nwf
*.nwd
*.xlsx
*.html
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.bmp
